# Python
__pycache__/

# Hardware session data: stays on the scanner PC. Raw USB captures carry
# image data and EEPROM payloads (docs/HARDWARE_RUNBOOK.md §9); the EEPROM
# dump is the unit's factory calibration. The converted .jsonl files and
# diff.txt are the shareable artifacts.
*.pcap
*.pcapng
eeprom.bin
*.pakraw
*.scan.json
*.scan-stats.txt
*.console.txt
/*.tiff
